DESCRIPTION:In a rare change of approach to children\, Katie Williams and
  Sophie McConville formally invite your little people to a Halloween bas
 h of spectacular proportions. You will enter a haunted hallway full of g
 houls and monsters greeted by vikings before entering the formal party a
 rea by the witches themselves where you will be taught to mix potions\, 
 dance like demons and solve wizardly puzzles. Some light refreshments an
 d snacks will be provided. Halloween dress is mandatory (yes that includ
 es parents). A separate adults only evening mixer invite will follow in 
 due course. 
